  "changes_html": "<h2>About This Vintage</h2><p>This is a historical reconstruction of The Budget Lab's \"State of U.S. Tariffs: January 19, 2026\" report, restructured to match the current interactive's data format. \"Baseline\" reflects tariff policy as it stood on January 19, 2026; \"With Greenland Tariffs\" models the counterfactual in which new tariffs on Greenland-linked goods are not imposed. Unlike other vintages in this archive, this one presents each scenario as its own independent tab rather than a combined levels-vs-baseline comparison view.</p>",
